-- title:
--   Choose homogeneous coefficients in coordinate power relations
-- statement:
--   If coordinate powers lie in the ideal generated by polynomials homogeneous of degree D, their ideal-membership expressions can be chosen with every coefficient homogeneous in the complementary degree.
-- source:
--   openai/math Ampleness stack: WeightedIdealCurveBound implies eps-ample exceptional twist, hence Serre vanishing and eventual generation of I^n by weight ≤ n(rho+eps) sections.

import Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic
